        ],
        "outcome": "not-feasible",
        "assessment": "World Myth & Literature includes Arabic and Near Eastern narratives. Stylistics, psycholinguistics, literary criticism and media analysis add transferable tools. The available courses do not develop Arabic speaking, reading or writing, a progression in Arabic literary study, or research with Arabic sources."
      },
      {
        "concept": "Middle Eastern history, society and culture",
        "generatingRegistryRows": [
          16672,
