        ],
        "outcome": "not-feasible",
        "assessment": "Renaissance Italy & Global Mediterranean studies exchanges with the Islamic eastern Mediterranean, and History of Empires includes ancient Persia. World Myth & Literature adds cross-cultural narrative analysis. Comparative history, heritage, social theory and methods cannot extend these contributions into sustained study of Middle Eastern and North African history and society."
      },
      {
        "concept": "Middle Eastern politics, contemporary debates and conflict",
        "generatingRegistryRows": [
          16675,
