          16682
        ],
        "supportingRegistryRows": [
          16702,
          16703,
          16708,
          16709
        ],
        "outcome": "not-feasible",
        "assessment": "Comparative Politics, International Relations, Peace & Conflict and international law give substantive tools for analysing institutions, war and settlements. Media and sociology give tools for analysing representation and public life. Those courses lack a sustained regional political and historical sequence or a progression in analysis of contemporary Arab societies and their sources."
      }
